  "comment": "In computing , a softphone is a software program for making telephone calls over the Internet using a general purpose computer, rather than using dedicated hardware. Often a softphone is designed to behave like a traditional telephone , sometimes appearing as an image of a phone, with a display panel and buttons with which the user can interact. A softphone is usually used with a headset",
